            Mr. Rime can technically participate in Pokémon GO
            PvP leagues, but its current overall ranking makes
            it a niche choice rather than a standard meta pick.
        </p>

    </div>


    <h3>
        Great League
    </h3>

    <p>
        Mr. Rime can fit under the Great League CP limit when
        appropriately powered, but it is generally a specialized
        choice rather than a core meta Pokémon.
    </p>


    <h3>
        Ultra League
    </h3>

    <p>
        Ultra League Mr. Rime requires careful IV and CP
        management. Its Ice/Psychic typing can provide useful
        coverage, although its defensive profile creates several
        difficult matchups.
    </p>


    <h3>
        Master League
    </h3>

    <p>
        Mr. Rime's maximum CP is relatively low compared with
        the Pokémon commonly used in Master League, making it
        a much less natural choice for this format.
    </p>

</section>


