    </h3>

    <p>
        No. XXL is a size classification rather than a direct
        combat-stat bonus. A normal-sized Mr. Rime and an XXL
        Mr. Rime can have the same IVs and combat performance.
    </p>


    <div class="feature-card">

        <strong>
