    <h3>
        What IVs Should You Keep?
    </h3>

    <ul class="checklist">

        <li>
            Keep 15/15/15 specimens for Hundo collections.
        </li>

        <li>
            Keep strong Attack IV specimens for PvE projects.
        </li>

        <li>
            Keep interesting low-attack IV combinations for
            league-specific PvP evaluation.
        </li>

        <li>
            Keep high-IV Lucky Pokémon for Stardust-efficient
            investments.
        </li>

        <li>
            Do not judge a Pokémon's usefulness only by its
            IV percentage.
        </li>

    </ul>

</section>


