        <h2>
            How to Use Mr. Rime
        </h2>

    </div>


    <h3>
        Before Investing
    </h3>

    <ul class="checklist">

        <li>
            Check the IVs.
        </li>

        <li>
            Check whether the Pokémon is Shiny, Shadow or
            Lucky.
        </li>

        <li>
            Check its current moveset.
        </li>

        <li>
            Compare it with your existing Ice attackers.
        </li>

        <li>
            Consider the Stardust and Candy investment.
        </li>

    </ul>


    <h3>
        For Collection
    </h3>

    <p>
        A complete Mr. Rime collection can include regular,
        Shiny, Shadow, Purified, Lucky, Hundo, XXS and XXL
        specimens. These categories can overlap, creating
        particularly rare combinations.
    </p>


